r16 MIRROR registration: step-capped workload (mean_turns 1000, max_turns 20), frozen model-F predictions and rules, pushed before any job

Cell sglang-fcfs-r1-mirror-k20: the E2 protocol (burst of 200 in [1200, 1260) s, 8700-s runs) with
configs/agentload_e2_mirror_k20.yaml, which is configs/agentload_e2_burst.yaml with two workload values
changed (mean_turns 15 -> 1000, max_turns 60 -> 20). BURST at 1.65x (decisive) and 1.35x (secondary),
NOBURST controls at 1.65x, seeds 0-2, plus one E0a of the workload (MODE=miss with GEN_EXTRA).

Theorem 2's turn-count factor reverses the youth premium for this workload; model F's plan-driven FIFO
predicts a completion blackout after the burst, a completion wave when the burst cohort finishes, and
completions below the all-miss capacity. Rules M1-M4 and secondary W5-W10 in analysis/r16_mirror.py;
frozen numbers in results/theory/r16/mirror_predictions.json and notes/PREDICTIONS_r16_mirror.md.
